    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA 23.6 acre (9.55 hectare) farm holding in Killeendaniel, Whitechurch held in Folio CRK35053. The land is of good quality with substantial road frontage. \n\nThis farm holding is accessed via a cul de sac road off the L2951. \n\nThere is a substantial corrugated shed on the property which is serviced with electricity and well water.\n\nThis farm is well situated, approximately 5.8km from Whitechurch village and 4.3km from Cork city. \n\nThis property is currently zoned as Metropolitan Green Belt 'and is open to future development potential subject to any planning and zoning constraints."
      },
